@startuml saga-happy-path
title Saga оформления заказа — успешный сценарий

actor Покупатель as customer
participant "Сервис заказов" as order
participant "Сервис склада" as inventory
participant "Сервис платежей" as payment
participant "Сервис доставки" as delivery
participant "Сервис уведомлений" as notification

customer -> order: Оформить заказ
activate order
order -> order: создать заказ ""New""

order ->> inventory: **OrderCreated**
inventory -> inventory: зарезервировать товар
inventory ->> order: **StockReserved**
order -> order: статус ""AwaitingPayment""

order ->> payment: **OrderAwaitingPayment**
payment -> payment: провести оплату
payment ->> order: **PaymentSucceeded**
order -> order: статус ""Paid""

order ->> delivery: **OrderPaid**
order ->> notification: **OrderStatusChanged**
notification -> customer: "Заказ оплачен"

delivery -> delivery: создать заявку на доставку
delivery ->> order: **ShipmentCreated**

...доставка едет к покупателю...

delivery ->> order: **ShipmentDelivered**
order -> order: статус ""Completed""
order ->> notification: **OrderStatusChanged**
notification -> customer: "Заказ доставлен"
deactivate order

@enduml
